597138513808654","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7641597138513808654","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"How it feels owning a horse. 🐴 😂 Financial ruin. 😂😂😂","views":27900},{"id":"7573405894533188877","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7573405894533188877","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"If you can’t laugh at yourself, you’re in the wrong sport!  For a little context, we lost my bay mare aka Spicy Secret unexpectedly in late April to colic. Despite aggressive treatment we couldn’t turn it around and she was not a good candidate for colic surgery.  We were all very sad and it’s taken me a while to find the right words to share her passing publicly. Oliver and Lego seemed lost without a third member of the herd, even several months after her passing.  When this kiddo popped up in my feed in June, things quickly fell into place for him to become a new family member. Meet Squiggy, (fka Vegas) 18 month old Dutch gelding. The big guys took to him quickly and although they miss their queen bee, Squiggy has become a needed distraction who is already much loved by everyone.  He will be appearing more frequently in content as he settles in. Let the games begin!  #Equestrian #yearling #equestrianlife #yolo #letthegamesbegin","views":18700},{"id":"7116942730953116970","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7116942730953116970","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"ICYMI We did the #barrelchallenge with @equineanddesign ! It’s much harder than it looks! #tiktoktuesdays #balance #fyp #equestrian #horsegirl #equestrianlife #farmhousetack #ariat #ogilvyequestrian","views":30700},{"id":"7680993830698552590","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7680993830698552590","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"Barn crimes have been commited. 🚨🐴 The evidence is questionable. The suspects are worse. Who are you questioning first? 😂 #horsetok #horsegirlproblems #equestrianhumor #barnlife #horsesoftiktok ","views":506},{"id":"7680992258677591310","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7680992258677591310","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"Horse girl math says if riding keeps you sane, it belongs in the wellness budget. 😂🐴 Are we wrong though? #horsegirlmath #horsetok #horsegirl #equestrianhumor #equestrianlife ","views":537},{"id":"7680989194734357774","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7680989194734357774","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"You waited until the last weekend of the Summer Sale, didn’t you? 👀😂 Good news: already-marked Summer Clearance is an extra 10% off through Labor Day. Shop the sale room or online before it’s gone. 🐴 #horsetok #horsegirlshopping #equestrianstyle #farmhousetack ","views":591},{"id":"7680990863056522510","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7680990863056522510","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"If horse stuff had dating profiles…the barn aisle would be a questionable place to look for love. 😂🐴 Which one are you swiping right on? #horsetok #horsegirl #horsehumor ##horsetack #horsesoftiktok","views":457},{"id":"7676494900958973198","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7676494900958973198","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"It always starts with “she just likes horses.” 😂🐴  Then suddenly the barn is the weekend plan and the tack shop knows you by name. Horse parents…when did you realize it was NOT a phase? 👀 #farmhousetack #horsegirl #horsetok #equestrian #horsemom ","views":3647},{"id":"7677999287401188621","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7677999287401188621","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"The tack room dating pool is…questionable 😂 Which one are you swiping right on? #horsetok #equestriantiktok #horsehumor #horsegirl #equestrian","views":1099},{"id":"7676585939736562958","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@farmhousetack/video/7676585939736562958","authorHandle":"farmhousetack","description":"